      "Section": "Organizations and Brands Overview",
      "Anchor": "organizations-and-brands-overview",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Deprecation Notice:\nThe Marketing Version 202510 (Marketing October 2025) will be sunset on October 15, 2026. We recommend that you migrate to the latest versioned APIs to avoid disruptions. For information on all the supported versions, refer to the migrations documentation.\nIf you haven\u2019t yet migrated and have questions, submit a request on the LinkedIn Developer Support Portal.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizations and Brands Overview",
      "Anchor": "organizations-and-brands-overview",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Use the Organizations and Brand APIs to create, update, and delete your organization and brand information. Additionally, the APIs support viewing analytics, notifications, sharing content, enable members to follow organizations, and view suggested organizations.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizations and Brands Overview",
      "Anchor": "organizations-and-brands-overview",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Unless otherwise specified, authenticated members must be assigned specific organization roles to use endpoints that retrieve, create, or modify an organization or its related data.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizational Entities",
